</div></div><div><p class="blog-summary"><p></p><p>A blog post from BEA Director Vipin Arora</p><p>I’d be willing to bet that the most effective and innovative places you’ve worked have had one thing in common: Great people. That’s certainly been my experience at BEA. While we make use of some remarkable technology, it’s really our people’s expertise and creativity—their human capital—that allows us to produce so many high-quality statistics.</p>
</p></div><div class="views-field views-field-title-1"><span class="field-content"><p><a href="  /news/blog/2026-10-05/how-does-investment-skilled-workforce-impact-nations-growth
">Read More&nbsp;<i class="fa fa-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></p></span></div></div>
