</div></div><div><p class="blog-summary"><p></p><p>A blog post from BEA Director Vipin Arora</p><p>“The reporting system that has been developed under the Social Security and Railroad Retirement Acts approaches the ideal as a source for income estimates.”</p><p>That statement, tucked away on page 63 of the first methodological handbook for the national accounts, is as true today as it was in 1951. 
</p></div><div class="views-field views-field-title-1"><span class="field-content"><p><a href="  /news/blog/2026-09-16/how-bls-quarterly-census-employment-and-wages-contributes-higher-quality-stats
