</div></div><div><p class="blog-summary"><p></p><p>A blog post from BEA Director Vipin Arora</p><p>My sons complain a lot about their chores—especially cutting the grass. I wonder if it would make them feel better to know that all their time sweating in the sun pushing a mower gets measured by BEA through our household production statistics. They might be even more excited to know the statistics are also capturing the other (unpaid) fun they have around the house like cleaning…</p></div><div class="views-field views-field-title-1"><span class="field-content"><p><a href="  /news/blog/2026-09-14/whats-economic-value-mowing-your-own-lawn
